// Value: protects=the /finance/payment-requests route derives the list's flags from the codes it already loaded: "Tạo yêu cầu" needs (payments.create_request or payments.manage) AND students.view, cancel needs payments.manage, profile links need students.view, today is the Vietnam date, now is the render's instant, and nothing loads without payments.view/manage;
// fails_when=the && students.view on canCreatePaymentRequests is dropped (a dead-end link to /new for the accountant), canViewStudents is not passed (the directory defaults to true and links profiles the viewer cannot open), cancel follows another code, today is the UTC date, now is not passed, or the rewritten payments guard lets a viewer without payment codes reach the loader;
// why_new=no test loaded this route; the directory and preview tests pass these flags as props, so the route wiring changed in step 14c was unproven;
